        "expected": "<div>\n@verbatim @foo(\n    a\n) @endverbatim\n@php(foo(\n    1,\n))\n@php $a = foo(\n    1\n); @endphp\n@if(\n    $a\n)\n@foo(match ($x) {\n    1 => 2\n})\n@foo($f(1)(\n    2,\n), 1 + (\n    3\n))\n@foo(\n    [1, 2], // c (\n    # d (\n    #[Attr]\n    /* e (\n    */\n    <<<EOT\n    x (\n    EOT,\n)\n@foo(\n    <<<\"EOT\"\n    x\n      EOTX\n    EOT,\n)\n@foo(<<< EOT\n    y\nEOT, <<<,\n)\n@bar(`x` \"y\\\"\" \n    1,\n)\n@foo(\"abc\n</div>"
